        <mxCell id="9NXy66vtsL3pgnV4Kw7D-57" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;heh9b5&quot; data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Step 1 — Ingest raw data using Databricks Jobs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1175&quot; data-end=&quot;1240&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;A Databricks Job runs a Python script to download CSV files from:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;https://www.football-data.co.uk/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1175&quot; data-end=&quot;1240&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Behavior:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i9b67z&quot; data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1330&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Downloads CSV per league and season&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h0fmhk&quot; data-start=&quot;1331&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Stores files in Volume (RAW layer)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;14k917v&quot; data-start=&quot;2000&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Step 2 — Bronze layer (ingestion with Auto Loader)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2056&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;Spark Declarative Pipelines (&lt;code data-start=&quot;2091&quot; data-end=&quot;2095&quot;&gt;dp&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; to ingest raw files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ngdk1c&quot; data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2134&quot;&gt;Behavior:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2135&quot; data-end=&quot;2224&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vqt4bo&quot; data-start=&quot;2135&quot; data-end=&quot;2164&quot;&gt;Reads CSV files from Volume&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ly26bn&quot; data-start=&quot;2165&quot; data-end=&quot;2198&quot;&gt;Uses Auto Loader (&lt;code data-start=&quot;2185&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;cloudFiles&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11r17nh&quot; data-start=&quot;2199&quot; data-end=&quot;2224&quot;&gt;Adds ingestion metadata&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;g8ti34&quot; data-start=&quot;2568&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Step 3 — Silver layer (data cleaning)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2653&quot;&gt;Transform Bronze data into clean datasets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;dveywu&quot; data-start=&quot;2655&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;Transformations:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2741&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m8ckbu&quot; data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2695&quot;&gt;Remove duplicates&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e6qe93&quot; data-start=&quot;2696&quot; data-end=&quot;2720&quot;&gt;Filter invalid records&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ni1s44&quot; data-start=&quot;2721&quot; data-end=&quot;2741&quot;&gt;Standardize schema&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;1skxuug&quot; data-start=&quot;2927&quot; data-end=&quot;2974&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Step 4 — Gold layer (business aggregations)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2976&quot; data-end=&quot;3015&quot;&gt;Create analytical tables for reporting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;xwfqoq&quot; data-start=&quot;3017&quot; data-end=&quot;3035&quot;&gt;Example logic:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3036&quot; data-end=&quot;3084&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wv8oki&quot; data-start=&quot;3036&quot; data-end=&quot;3063&quot;&gt;Combine home + away stats&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lt3v9v&quot; data-start=&quot;3064&quot; data-end=&quot;3084&quot;&gt;Aggregate per team&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;ijl2lp&quot; data-start=&quot;3250&quot; data-end=&quot;3297&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Step 5 — Orchestration with Databricks Jobs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3299&quot; data-end=&quot;3332&quot;&gt;Define a Job with two main steps:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1hrgyus&quot; data-start=&quot;3334&quot; data-end=&quot;3361&quot;&gt;Task 1 — Data ingestion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3362&quot; data-end=&quot;3416&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vqvl49&quot; data-start=&quot;3362&quot; data-end=&quot;3382&quot;&gt;Runs Python script&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i0miko&quot; data-start=&quot;3383&quot; data-end=&quot;3416&quot;&gt;Downloads CSV files into Volume&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;pxetb1&quot; data-start=&quot;3418&quot; data-end=&quot;3449&quot;&gt;Task 2 — Pipeline execution&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3450&quot; data-end=&quot;3518&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2ox6c9&quot; data-start=&quot;3450&quot; data-end=&quot;3483&quot;&gt;Runs Spark Declarative Pipeline&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13ckioc&quot; data-start=&quot;3484&quot; data-end=&quot;3518&quot;&gt;Processes Bronze → Silver → Gold&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;147z8l8&quot; data-start=&quot;3520&quot; data-end=&quot;3539&quot;&gt;Execution flow:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;147z8l8&quot; data-start=&quot;3520&quot; data-end=&quot;3539&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Download Job → Pipeline Run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
